{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52820","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 何千里","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锡鼎昇天几万春，裔孙今复出嚣尘。\n姓名当系上清籙，齿发不知何代人？\n暂应客星过世主，旋归吴市作遗民。\n辽东鹤驾忽飞去，挥手无言辞紫宸。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何千里","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}